msgid "**Randomize position** Adjust random position settings."
msgstr "**Randomize position** Adjust random position settings."

msgid "**Render auto-layers** Enable or disable the rendering of tiles in all Auto-Layers. If disabled, only the underlying IntGrid values will be displayed."
msgstr "**Render auto-layers** Enable or disable the rendering of tiles in all Auto-Layers. If disabled, only the underlying IntGrid values will be displayed."

msgid "**Select empty spaces** If this option is enabled when you select a level area with ALT+SHIFT+click, the selection will also include EMPTY grid cells."
msgstr "**Select empty spaces** If this option is enabled when you select a level area with ALT+SHIFT+click, the selection will also include EMPTY grid cells."

msgid "**Show/hide details** When enabled, shows all elements in layers (tiles, entities, intGrid etc.), or only tiles otherwise."
msgstr "**Show/hide details** When enabled, shows all elements in layers (tiles, entities, intGrid etc.), or only tiles otherwise."

msgid "**Show/hide enum tags** When enabled, shows a color overlay on tiles that have an Enum tag attached to them (see the Tilesets panel to tag tiles using Enums).\\nOnly applies to Tiles layers and Auto-layers."
msgstr "**Show/hide enum tags** When enabled, shows a color overlay on tiles that have an Enum tag attached to them (see the Tilesets panel to tag tiles using Enums).\\nOnly applies to Tiles layers and Auto-layers."

msgid "**Single layer mode** Enable this to fade all other layers, and focus on active layer only. NOTE: this will also affect the Selection tool (ALT+click)."
msgstr "**Single layer mode** Enable this to fade all other layers, and focus on active layer only. NOTE: this will also affect the Selection tool (ALT+click)."

msgid "**Stop on match** If this rule is applied in a grid cell, it will prevent all the rules below to apply"
msgstr "**Stop on match** If this rule is applied in a grid cell, it will prevent all the rules below to apply"

msgid "**Tile stacking** Only applies to Tiles layers. If this option is enabled, you will be able to stack multiple tiles in a single grid cell."
msgstr "**Tile stacking** Only applies to Tiles layers. If this option is enabled, you will be able to stack multiple tiles in a single grid cell."

msgid "**X mirror** This rule can be reversed HORIZONTALLY to match more cases."
msgstr "**X mirror** This rule can be reversed HORIZONTALLY to match more cases."

msgid "**Y mirror** This rule can be reversed VERTICALLY to match more cases."
msgstr "**Y mirror** This rule can be reversed VERTICALLY to match more cases."

msgid "**Zen mode** This mode automatically hides the left panel to give more editing space."
msgstr "**Zen mode** This mode automatically hides the left panel to give more editing space."

